Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["Main-State Dithered Diagnostic Trial: (a,c) = (5,1)", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"95305ca8-804e-3d46-b7f5-2bf7ce6e00ec"],

Cell["\<\
This notebook tests whether deterministic midpoint stratification is \
responsible for the persistent biexciton symmetry discrepancies. It imports \
the existing (5,1) optimum and evaluates seven selected XX diagnostic \
integrals with AdaptiveQuasiMonteCarlo, BisectionDithering = 0.1, MaxPoints = \
10^6, and three fixed random seeds. The same seed is used across the seven \
integrals within each replicate to provide common random numbers. No \
minimization is performed, production defaults are not changed, and \
production results are not overwritten. A separate checkpoint is written \
after every seed.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"f3f5c78e-0b64-104e-8855-21f6d727e756"],

